#: processes/ig-incremental-build.bpmn:225
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Combine the restored per-artefact records with the cone's freshly rendered ones into one complete set, so the meta-index rebuild that follows has every artefact's record and never re-derives one."
msgstr ""

#: processes/ig-incremental-build.bpmn:171
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Compile the restricted checkout with SUSHI — the cone's FSH, not the whole IG. A build optimisation, not a validation shortcut: SUSHI compiling is not conformance, so a green compile goes on to validation rather than standing in for it."
msgstr ""

