msgstr ""

#: processes/ig-incremental-build.bpmn:260
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Decided in the reviewer's QC gate (Task_Qa, `quality-control`) over qa.json, the aggregate of per-artefact outcomes, reading the cone's rows first. `no` files each QC finding as a bean, checking for an existing one first, and returns the findings to the author. `yes` goes on to deploy."
msgstr ""

