#: processes/ig-incremental-build.bpmn:55
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Where every failure branch lands before the process ends rather than just stopping: Gateway_Valid's `no`, Gateway_QcPass's `no` and Gateway_Restore's `environment error` each write here — Task_LogFindings, Task_QcBeans, Task_LogEnvError — before EndEvent_Findings, EndEvent_FindingsQc or EndEvent_EnvError, so a run that stops short always leaves a record of why rather than only a red check."
msgstr ""

